  "statement": {
    "status": "present",
    "value": "Wrap an injected getPage(zeroBasedPage) provider. read(k) returns up to k strings without losing unused page tails. Empty pages mean terminal EOF; interior empty pages are excluded because the preview exposes no independent continuation signal. read(0) must not fetch. The trace adapter injects a finite page fixture; fetchCount is an authored observability method.",
